 

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = GANTI_DENGAN_ACCESS_TOKEN_LO

 GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json
 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Tambah drink (amount harus angka positif)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 250
}
 
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500,
  "time": "2026-10-21T08:00:00.000Z"
}
 
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -5
}
 
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 250,
  "time": "bukan tanggal"
}
 
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List notifikasi dengan goal custom
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?goal=3000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
 POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time": "10:00",
  "type": "custom",
  "enabled": true
}
 
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time": "25:99"
}
 POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time": "10:00",
  "type": "bogus"
}

### Update reminder (ganti :id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time": "12:00"
}
 
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time": "12:00"
} 
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/due
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/auto
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/auto
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "startTime": "07:00",
  "endTime": "22:00",
  "intervalMinutes": 60
}


PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/auto
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "22:00",
  "endTime": "07:00"
}


PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/auto
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intervalMinutes": 5
}


POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/reset/0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
 
 GET {{baseUrl}}/api/push/vapid-public-key
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
 POST {{baseUrl}}/api/push/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscription": {
    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/fake-endpoint",
    "keys": {
      "p256dh": "BEl62iUYgUivxIkv69yViEuiBIaI8sgAz2kdG0k9eq8k3kQ",
      "auth": "aBcD1eF2gH3iJ4kL5mN6oP7qR8sT9uV0"
    }
  }
}

### Kasus error: subscription tanpa keys -> harus 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/push/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscription": {
    "endpoint": "https://contoh.com/push"
  }
}

### Kirim test push ke semua device user ini
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/push/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ==========================================================
### 7. KASUS ERROR AUTH
### ==========================================================
### Tanpa token -> 401 "Token tidak ditemukan" (atau 200 mode=dev-bypass di lokal)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks
Accept: application/json

### Token ngaco -> harus 401 "Token tidak valid atau sudah kadaluarsa"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks
Authorization: Bearer token-ngaco-123
Accept: application/json

### Endpoint gak ada -> harus 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tidak-ada
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ==========================================================
### 8. TIGA CARA KIRIM TOKEN
### ==========================================================
### 8a. Bearer header -> respons header "X-Auth-Mode: bearer"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8b. Query string -> respons header "X-Auth-Mode: query"
###     ini yang bisa dibuka langsung di address bar browser
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks?token={{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8c. Tanpa token -> respons header "X-Auth-Mode: dev-bypass"
###     hanya di development lokal (DEV_AUTH_BYPASS), nonaktif di produksi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drinks
Accept: application/json
